{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME STRUCTURED FOR MULTIPLE GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/37146844e9c961c225a6eb252090e50e.avif?t=1764994860\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4Wheel Challenge</strong> is a single-player <strong>offline</strong> game structured to feature multiple game modes, each bringing unique challenges and distinct gameplay styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the main mode is <strong>TenLevels</strong> \u2014 a series of progressively challenging stages that test your precision, reflexes, and total control of the wheelchair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>TENLEVELS \u2014 THE MAIN CHALLENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/1092dbf5ea6b2c54001b752f08f0640c.avif?t=1764994860\" width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles, platforms, and ramps across 10 levels full of challenges. Show your skill and master every course to the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCORING SYSTEM \u2014 FROM \u201cF\u201d TO \u201cA\u201d, AIM FOR THE LEGENDARY \u201cS\u201d RANK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/a8b0c609124827c4410de3bfba03cc8c.avif?t=1764994860\" width=1560 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is graded based on your performance. Improve your time, avoid falls, and reach the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>HIGHLIGHTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Precise and responsive gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Vibrant low-poly visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intense and progressive challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fully offline and single-player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 New free game modes every 3 months</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Do you have what it takes to earn an S rank on every level?</strong></i></u></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/a34ecdd2519a9434aa88fd4cc1e16e09278ce969.jpg"},{"name":"On the Way to the Top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/a83d8b413c0347c9ca825083c83a089e832639b0.jpg"},{"name":"Wheel Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/71f8a1820940f1da38a33173b87bd153102a39c2.jpg"},{"name":"Wheel Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/42d1bc1a92456a7f6e7301f1b8d28ebf4969a11f.jpg"},{"name":"Wheel Demigod","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/c947ffe088fa5550226fc205b2db9de360fa146d.jpg"},{"name":"Wheel God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/4cb215185fc05cc4069ef5922b97c58b33665fd3.jpg"},{"name":"Losing a Wheel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/b731ba111cbd0fb7ba96ba87dfaa78d98cdb802e.jpg"},{"name":"Loose Wheel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/d627a45620c4e622e96bf46a2d55ce0a083792f7.jpg"},{"name":"Wheel on Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504700/33f99e82e8e0f870abb9e075310ad28144539db7.jpg"},{"name":"Cheater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/